CONTROL name=gdn-state-transposition-reddens fired=RED legs=host_cpubody:2 claims=host_cpubody 2 compiled legs (g++ twin, hipcc host path) ran `state_xpose` through `m2d_state_dot`: q_hat and k_hat bit-identical to each arm's honest record, all five state-reading stages moved, none of them closer to the pin than honest, and at least one strictly further on each arm; the arm's own reach table named exactly those five, and the transposed record comes back REJECTED on at least one of the four licensed stages (`band_reddened_on` per leg), so what reddens is the licence and not a distance this file chose. The transposition is invisible to shape checks (d_k == d_v == 128) and visible here because the pinned incoming state has 509952 live words
CONTROL name=gdn-carry-index-reddens fired=RED legs=host_cpubody:2 claims=host_cpubody both compiled arms took the decay multiplier from head (h+1) % 32: the fingerprint of the state bytes they read is UNCHANGED from the honest run (2525565901 and 3508630800 both equal the driver's own fold) while all five state-derived fields move and none gets closer to the pin, so the difference is in what the step carried and not in what it read. host_twin[same_state_read=yes input_only_identical=True state_stages_moved=True strictly_further=scan_out,core_attn,state,normed,y]; hip_hostpath[same_state_read=yes input_only_identical=True state_stages_moved=True strictly_further=scan_out,core_attn,state,normed,y]
CONTROL name=gdn-non-carried-state-reddens fired=RED legs=host_cpubody:4 claims=host_cpubody two legs, both compilers, executed: zeroing the state span in the slab leaves q_hat and k_hat bit-identical, leaves the state row very far from the pin, and moves the arm's fingerprint to exactly the all-zero fold the driver computes over those bytes; the arm's own zero-state fault reports reads_state=0 and a zero fingerprint, which the driver's reconciliation requires rather than permits. host_twin[bytes-zeroed=RED(arm_sum=0 driver_sum=0 state_ndiff 85187->417408) arm-fault=RED(reads_state=0 state_ndiff 85187->417408)]; hip_hostpath[bytes-zeroed=RED(arm_sum=0 driver_sum=0 state_ndiff 85187->417408) arm-fault=RED(reads_state=0 state_ndiff 85187->417408)]
DVOID control-leg=gdn-device-readback status=not-exercised reason=needs-a-device-window note=no host body printed a read-back line, and none was allowed to: the host path binds file bytes to slab bytes by digest instead
CONTROL name=gdn-state-read-is-the-arm-s-own-fingerprint fired=RED legs=host_cpubody:2 claims=host_cpubody honest legs: d_hip_hostpath=agree(sum arm=2525565901 driver=2525565901 live=509952/509952); d_host_twin=agree(sum arm=2525565901 driver=2525565901 live=509952/509952) — the arm's modular fold of the state's 524288 words equals the driver's fold of the bytes it wrote, on every arm that ran, with 509952 live words as a non-zero denominator. Flip legs: host_twin[fingerprint 2525565901->2525566144 agrees=True state_ndiff 85187->85188 scan_out_ndiff 3511->3511]; hip_hostpath[fingerprint 2525565901->2525566144 agrees=True state_ndiff 85187->85188 scan_out_ndiff 3511->3511] — flipping one byte of the state's 77,777th word moves the fingerprint on both sides, keeps them equal, and pushes the state row further from the pin while no derived row gets closer, so the number is a witness of the read and not a constant the arm prints.
CONTROL name=gdn-form-not-merged fired=RED legs=host_cpubody:2 claims=host_cpubody the arm reported form=recurrent on every one of its 2 parsed run records (recurrent); `chunked|pinned` grants 0 of the seven rows at this pass (so the two forms are not interchangeable here, which is the premise of this whole vertical); both binaries refused a plan declaring form=chunked (host_twin:form-not-implemented,hip_hostpath:form-not-implemented); 4 ACCEPTED rows all name `recurrent|pinned` in their licence and every granted stage is among them (none). Honest legs ran under both compilers so the claim is about executed reports.
CONTROL name=gdn-poison-census-can-be-nonzero fired=RED the honest record carries no poison in any of the seven fields on either compiler; forbidding one stage each makes its own field read entirely poison (host_twin[skip-carry field=state poison=524288/524288 q_hat=0 k_hat=0]; hip_hostpath[skip-out field=scan_out poison=4096/4096 q_hat=0 k_hat=0]), which is the leg that shows the census can be non-zero instead of merely printing zero
CONTROL name=gdn-plan-refusals-fire fired=RED 10 refusals across two binaries, each named: host_twin/state-is-bf16:field-elt; host_twin/v_pre-wrong-words:field-words; host_twin/missing-g_decay:field-missing; host_twin/chunked-lane-mode:mode-unknown; host_twin/gather-lane-fault:fault-unknown; hip_hostpath/state-is-bf16:field-elt; hip_hostpath/v_pre-wrong-words:field-words; hip_hostpath/missing-g_decay:field-missing; hip_hostpath/chunked-lane-mode:mode-unknown; hip_hostpath/gather-lane-fault:fault-unknown. A plan this arm should not be able to run is refused before a byte is read, which is what makes the honest run's spans worth something
